  "description": "TTS server (MODEL_SERVICE=tts) — the two stages of speech generation, measured separately so a slowdown can be pinned to one of them: autoregressive codec-token decode, and vocoder waveform reconstruction (audio seconds produced per wall second). Both are broken out per device, replica and model; decode additionally by voice source, vocoding by batch size.",
